      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: turn_for_what; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic; overall-intent-description: The image shows a man in a car looking confused, with the text 'turn for what?' overlaid. This is a common meme format used to express bewilderment or confusion about a situation or instruction. The scene is neutral and does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content. The intent is to humorously convey confusion, not to target or demean any group or individual. There are no elements of toxicity, abuse, cyberbullying, harmfulness, hate, misogyny, or propaganda present in the image.",
